{"id": "EUVD-2026-89435", "enisaUuid": "0eaf577d-cb7a-377c-92bd-1b057ac94007", "description": "U-Boot before 2026.10-rc5 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the httpc_recv_cb() function within the lwIP wget implementation. When HTTP data storage fails, the callback frees the connection PCB but returns ERR_BUF instead of ERR_ABRT, causing the TCP input path to access released memory and crash the bootloader.", "datePublished": "2026-09-29T21:29:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-02T12:30:17", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot/commit/2d94618a58aeb7630f18eee33419ce48d0fd3616", "https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot/blob/v2026.07/net/lwip/wget.c#L194", "https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/u-boot-before-2026.10-rc5-use-after-free-in-lwip-wget-receive-callback"], "aliases": ["GHSA-fm4f-g9jh-3qfq", "CVE-2026-74222"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b201c5d2-dfb8-3623-affc-29f39d9a2dfa", "product": {"name": "U-Boot", "vendor": {"name": "DENX Software Engineering"}}, "product_version": "0 <2026.10-rc5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0018a7e4-f650-3899-9027-1dce04ebb21d", "vendor": {"name": "U-Boot"}}], "isExploited": false}